  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "\"Hello VRChat Team,\n\nI am an active player on the Android Beta version. I really enjoy the experience, but I feel limited by the lack of hand and arm movement. It is difficult to interact or express myself freely like VR or PC users.\n\nI suggest adding a 'Virtual Joystick' or a 'Drag-to-move' feature for the arms, or perhaps utilizing the phone’s camera for basic hand tracking in future updates. This would make the mobile experience much more immersive.\n\nThank you for your hard work",
